      "FIFO depth is 4 entries unless overridden by parameter.",
      "The FIFO uses a single clock domain.",
      "Reset is synchronous active-low as required by the project rules.",
      "The FIFO is intended for low-area implementation using distributed registers or LUT RAM rather than block RAM.",
      "Input transfers occur when in_valid and in_ready are both asserted.",
      "Output transfers occur when out_valid and out_ready are both asserted.",
      "The FIFO may accept and produce data in the same cycle when neither empty/full rules prohibit the operation."
    ]
